{"2473620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You've been ReMaid!", "steam_appid": 2473620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hotel Goetia. A mansion swathed in mystery that even the bravest of souls dare not enter! Prepare to be on edge as you are hunted by the unlikeliest of enemies: cute but relentless maids! Only these maids don't just clean the house, they're also more than willing to beat some manners into you if your intent is to cause trouble in their workplace! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the mansion's dark past, reveal hidden secrets and get to the bottom of what really happened there. Will you get to the bottom of this mystery and remake the timeline? Or will you become another dead resident?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>FEATURES:</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charming stylized anime graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  - A mix of semi immersive sim elements, action and stealth with a small pinch of horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings and playable characters each with their own distinctive playstyles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Certain enemies exhibit advanced decision-making skills and  react to your actions.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hotel Goetia. A mansion swathed in mystery that even the bravest of souls dare not enter! Prepare to be on edge as you are hunted by the unlikeliest of enemies: cute but relentless maids! Only these maids don't just clean the house, they're also more than willing to beat some manners into you if your intent is to cause trouble in their workplace! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D